SUMMARY:Easy run 3.5 km\, HR under 155. Genuinely easy
DESCRIPTION:Easy run 3.5 km\, HR under 155. Genuinely easy - this is the 
 km that builds the engine.\n\nWeek 2 of 19 - Recovery\nDOWN WEEK - recov
 er\, do not add volume.\nKeep HR under 150. Walk the climbs. Talk test.\
 nZone 2 ONLY\, HR under 145. No quality of any kind. Ten to twenty-four 
 days of easy is the protocol\; training hard here only lengthens recover
 y.\n123 days to Goal 5 km - Amsterdamse Bos parkrun.
