DTSTAMP:20260909T193326Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20270601
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20270602
SUMMARY:SUB-THRESHOLD 6 x 3 min (9 km)
DESCRIPTION:SUB-THRESHOLD 6 x 3 min - Pace comes from your most recent Am
 sterdamse Bos parkrun\, never a number written months earlier. Threshold
  = HR 175-180. Sub-threshold = HR 168-174\, must not feel hard. VO2max =
  set by pace\, confirmed by the HR you FINISH on\, 186-193. Warm up 15 m
 in\, cool down 10 min.\n\nWeek 6 of 19 - Ramp\nFrequency 5. First struct
 ured session in six weeks\, and deliberately sub-threshold rather than t
 hreshold.\n95 days to Goal 5 km - Amsterdamse Bos parkrun.
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
