SUMMARY:◆ Strength LOWER (40 min)
DESCRIPTION:Strength LOWER - HEAVY\, 40 min. Trap-bar deadlift 4 x 3 at 8
 8-92% 1RM\, Bulgarian split squat 3 x 5/leg\, calf raises 3 x 8 loaded. 
 COMPLEX PAIRING: 5 box jumps or 20 m bounds within 2 min of each heavy s
 et. Heavy strength improves running economy\; plyometrics alone do not. 
 Keep at least 3 h between this and any run - that is the interval the co
 ncurrent-training work says clears molecular interference. LOWER-LEG AND
  FOOT\, 5 min: tibialis raises 3 x 15-20\, heel walks 2 x 20 m\, short-f
 oot holds 3 x 30 s/side.\n\nWeek 19 of 19 - Race\nRACE WEEK. Volume down
  50% from peak\, frequency held at four. GOAL 5 KM Saturday 4 Sep. Every
 thing since May converges on about 25 minutes of running.\n2 days to Goa
 l 5 km - Amsterdamse Bos parkrun.
